		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Forty-foot-long centipede formed of conjoined human skeletons, topped with a giant's skull, burning red eyes. Not undead but created by an insane wizard.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 44, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 bite +5 (2d6) and 1 dance, <strong>MV</strong> near (climb), <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> -3, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 9</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Construct</strong>. Only damaged by adamantine or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Dance</strong>. All enemies in near range who can see necrophidius, CHA 15+ or helplessly entranced for 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Powerful Aura</strong>. Hostile spells targeting the necrophidius are DC 18 to cast.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
